r would be to your left — since the desk is to the right of the counter in the overall layout.\n\nT<abs_vis_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>Therefore, the counter is located to the front-left of the person standing at the toilet looking toward the desk.\n</spatial_thinking>\n\n<thinking><abs_vis_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>From the toilet’s position, the counter is part of the kitchen area, which lies to the left of the desk when facing it. Therefore, when standing at the toilet and looking toward the desk, the counter is in the front-left direction.\n\nA<abs_vis_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>This matches option D: front-left.\n</thinking>\n\n<answer>D</answer><|im_end|>","latent":{"blocks":6,"body_tokens":96,"events":[{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":1,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":2,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":3,"kind":"source_step","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body